## 📍 Where We Started

**Initial State:**
- ✅ Expo app running
- ✅ Basic authentication (signup/login)
- ❌ Email verification blocking users
- ❌ ProfileScreen querying wrong table
- ❌ Missing school_id in signup
- ❌ No school hierarchy
- ❌ No invite system
- ❌ Generic "Default School" for everyone

**User Needs:**
1. Proper Sri Lankan school classification (1AB, 1C, Type 2, Type 3)
2. Organizational hierarchy (sections, grades)
3. Flexible signup (solo teachers + invite codes)
4. Role-based UI (Principal sees different tabs than teachers)
5. NOT forced into one rigid workflow

