- `subscriptions` - Free/Pro/Premium tiers

**Security:**
- Row Level Security (RLS) enabled
- Multi-tenant isolation working
- Email confirmation disabled for development

---

### 2. **Sri Lankan School System** 🇱🇰

**School Types Added:**
```
Government Schools:
├─ 1AB - ජාතික පාසල (National Schools)
├─ 1C - පළාත් පාසල (Provincial Schools)
├─ Type 2 - O/L දක්වා (Up to O/L)
└─ Type 3 - ප්‍රාථමික (Primary only)

Other Schools:
├─ Semi-Government
├─ Private
├─ International
├─ Pirivena (Buddhist)
└─ Personal Workspace (Solo teachers)
```

**Organizational Hierarchy:**
```
School (Principal)
└── Sections (Section Heads)
    ├─ Primary (Grades 1-5)
    ├─ Junior (Grades 6-9)
    └─ Senior (Grades 10-13)
        └── Grades (Grade Heads)
            └── Classrooms (Teachers)
                └── Students
```

**New Database Tables:**
- `sections` - School sections (Primary/Junior/Senior)
- `grades` - Grade levels (1-13) with grade heads
- Updated `users` - Added section_id, grade_id columns

**User Roles:**
- Principal (Level 1 - sees entire school)
- Section Head (Level 2 - sees their section)
- Grade Head (Level 3 - sees their grade)
- Teacher (Level 4 - sees assigned classes)
- Student (Level 5 - sees own class)

---

### 3. **Flexible Signup System** 🚀

**Before:**
```
Everyone → Creates "Default School" ❌
```

**After:**
```
Principal → Creates "[Name]'s School" (1AB type)
        ↓
    Gets invite codes:
    ├─ GURU-ABC123-TEACH (teachers)
    └─ GURU-ABC123-STUDY (students)

Teacher/Student (Solo) → Creates "[Name]'s Workspace"
                      → Can join real school later

Teacher/Student (Invited) → Enters code
                         → Auto-joins school
```

**Key Innovation:**
- ✅ Solo teachers can start immediately
- ✅ No waiting for principal
- ✅ Can join official school anytime via code
- ✅ No duplicate "Default School" entries

---

### 4. **Invite Code System** 🎫

**Database Table:**
- `invite_codes` - School invitation codes
- `profile_completion` - Track user profile progress

**Features Built:**
- Code format: `GURU-ABC123-TEACH` (auto-validates)
- Code validation with school lookup
- Usage tracking (max_uses, uses_count)
- Expiry dates (optional)
- Role-specific codes (teacher vs student)

**UI Components Created:**
- [InviteCodeEntry.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/InviteCodeEntry.tsx) - Code input screen
- [inviteCodes.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/lib/inviteCodes.ts) - Validation utilities
- Auto-formatting as user types
- Multilingual error messages

**Status**: Database ready, UI built, NOT YET integrated with signup flow

